{"unit_id":"yunshu-iii__dsh-wallpaper-theme#card-zh","repo":"yunshu-iii/dsh-wallpaper-theme","commit":"97079a8391da4adfa40fec7cb348d87d0f20c4f6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-theme 是 DSH Harness 的外观插件，在侧栏底部添加主题与壁纸按钮，并打开集中的设置面板。它把用户选择的图片绘制为整窗背景，同时按浅色和深色方案分别保存壁纸或使用内置渐变；面板可管理图片图库、调节全窗或浮窗布局、磨砂与透明度、模糊和暗化效果，还能设置图库图片自动轮换。上传图片会在浏览器端缩放，图库和外观参数保存在本机 DSH 数据目录。适合想为 Harness 界面添加个人背景、并分别微调对话区、侧栏和卡片可读性的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1603-1616","client.js:176-183","index.js:341-580","client.js:365-390","index.js:149-154"]}
{"unit_id":"yunshu-iii__dsh-wallpaper-theme#card-en","repo":"yunshu-iii/dsh-wallpaper-theme","commit":"97079a8391da4adfa40fec7cb348d87d0f20c4f6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wallpaper-theme adds an appearance panel to DSH Harness. Choose local wallpapers or gradients for light and dark modes, manage a gallery, and adjust full-window or floating-card layout, blur, dimming, and surface opacity. Images and settings stay in the local DSH data directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1603-1616","client.js:176-183","index.js:341-580","client.js:365-390","index.js:149-154"]}
