{"unit_id":"yunshu-iii__dsh-wallpaper-theme#feature-1","repo":"yunshu-iii/dsh-wallpaper-theme","commit":"97079a8391da4adfa40fec7cb348d87d0f20c4f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-theme 的功能「本机壁纸图库」：从面板上传图片，浏览图库并选择用于浅色或深色外观。上传图像在浏览器中缩放处理，主机端按内容去重并保存到本机图库。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:365-390","client.js:1426-1455","index.js:384-426"]}
{"unit_id":"yunshu-iii__dsh-wallpaper-theme#feature-2","repo":"yunshu-iii/dsh-wallpaper-theme","commit":"97079a8391da4adfa40fec7cb348d87d0f20c4f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-theme 的功能「壁纸与表面外观调节」：在面板选择整窗铺满或浮窗卡片布局，并设置图片模糊、暗化、玻璃地板和不同界面的透明度。调整值通过应用操作写入设置，再由样式表绘制到界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:399-498","client.js:1384-1420"]}
{"unit_id":"yunshu-iii__dsh-wallpaper-theme#feature-3","repo":"yunshu-iii/dsh-wallpaper-theme","commit":"97079a8391da4adfa40fec7cb348d87d0f20c4f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-theme 的功能「渐变预设与自动轮换」：用户可按浅色或深色方案选内置渐变，也可开启定时轮换，让图库图片按设定间隔依次成为壁纸。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:176-183","index.js:246-263","client.js:1163-1199"]}
