{"unit_id":"yunshu-iii__dsh-wallpaper-theme#caveat-1","repo":"yunshu-iii/dsh-wallpaper-theme","commit":"97079a8391da4adfa40fec7cb348d87d0f20c4f6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper-theme 使用前须知：图库和外观参数保存在 DSH_HOME/wallpaper-theme；未设置 DSH_HOME 时目录为 ~/.dsh/wallpaper-theme。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:75-76","index.js:149-154"]}
